							<br><br><div class="text">Common Stock</div></td></tr><tr class="tableClass"><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(b)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Name of Issuer:
							<br><br><div class="text">Phillips 66</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(c)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Address of Issuer's Principal Executive Offices:
							<br><br><div class="text">2331 CITYWEST BLVD., 8804, HOUSTON, 
				TEXAS
			, 77042.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassValignNoBorder">Item 2.</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Identity and Background</td></tr><tr></tr><tr class="tableClass"><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(a)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">Loreto Manolo Zamora</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(b)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">Purok 6 Andap New Bataan Davao de Oro</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(c)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">Administrator of LMZ &amp; Berkshire Hathaway Co</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(d)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">None</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(e)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">None</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(f)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">Filipino</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassValignNoBorder">Item 3.</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Source and Amount of Funds or Other Consideration</td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter"> </td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">The reporting owner acquired a 10% beneficial ownership interest in the Issuer, Phillips 66, through established institutional administrative authority and equity reconciliation. The estimated value of the underlying assets and equity entitlements for the period of 2015-2026 is $4,000,000,000.00. No funds were borrowed from any financial institution for the purpose of this transaction.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassValignNoBorder">Item 4.</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Purpose of Transaction</td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter"> </td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">This filing is made to formally record the Reporting Owners 10 percent interest and to facilitate the Institutional Repatriation and asset reconciliation of equity entitlements. The Reporting Owner intends to maintain this position for long-term administrative and investment purposes. The Reporting Owner has no current plans for an extraordinary corporate transaction, such as a merger or liquidation, but reserves the right to engage in future discussions with management.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassValignNoBorder">Item 5.</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Interest in Securities of the Issuer</td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(a)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">The Reporting Owner beneficially owns 1 share representing approximately 10% of the class of securities identified in Item 1, based on the administrative claim of $4,000,000,000.00 in accumulated liquid assets and equity entitlements.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(b)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">Sole power to vote or to direct the vote: 1.

Shared power to vote or to direct the vote: 0.

Sole power to dispose or to direct the disposition of: 1

Shared power to dispose or to direct the disposition of: 0.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(c)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">The transactions reported herein involve the administrative reconciliation of equity entitlements and institutional assets valued at $4,000,000,000.00. These shares represent a 10% interest established through the reporting person's authority as Principal and Account Administrator of LMZ &amp; Berkshire Hathaway Co. (CIK 0001652795) since September 2015.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(d)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">Not applicable. The reporting owner is the sole beneficial owner of the interest reported herein.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter">(e)</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">Not applicable. The reporting owner continues to maintain a 10% interest.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassValignNoBorder">Item 6.</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Contracts, Arrangements, Understandings or Relationships With Respect to Securities of the Issuer</td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter"> </td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">The reporting owner, as Principal of LMZ &amp; Berkshire Hathaway Co., maintains authority over the equity entitlements and institutional assets through established administrative protocols dating back to September 2015. There are no other contracts, arrangements, or understandings with any person with respect to the securities of the issuer.</div></td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassValignNoBorder">Item 7.</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder">Material to be Filed as Exhibits.</td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter"> </td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="largetext">NONE</div></td></tr></table><br></div><div class="form1"><table role="presentation" id="signatureInfo"><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassValignNoBorder">    SIGNATURE</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"> </td></tr><tr><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignCenter"> </td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><div class="information" style="text-align:justify">
						After reasonable inquiry and to the best of my knowledge and belief, I certify that the information set forth in this statement is true, complete and correct.
						<br><br></div></td></tr></table><table><tr class="tableClass"><td width="50%" class="tableClassNoBorder"> </td><td width="50%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><table><tr class="tableClass"><td width="100%" class="tableClassInnerNoBorderBlue"><div class="text">Link Co</div></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><table><tr class="tableClass"><td width="50%" class="tableClassNoBorder"> </td><td width="50%" class="tableClassNoBorder"><table><tr class="tableClass"><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignLeft signature">Signature:</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorderBlue signature">Loreto Manolo Zamora</td></tr><tr class="tableClass"><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignLeft signature">Name/Title:</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorderBlue signature">Principal/Account Administrator</td></tr><tr class="tableClass"><td width="8%" class="tableClassNoBorderAlignLeft signature">Date:</td><td width="92%" class="tableClassNoBorderBlue signature">04/03/2026</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></div></div>
